<section class="page-hero page-hero--plain">
  <div class="page-hero__inner"><h1 class="page-hero__title">About Us</h1></div>
</section>

<section class="section section--light mvg">
  <div class="container mvg__cols">
    <div class="mvg__left">
      <h5>Our Mission</h5>
      <p><strong>Our Mission</strong> is to provide affordable urgent dental care through volunteer dentists to low-income Torontonians who have nowhere else to turn.</p>
      <h5>Our Vision</h5>
      <p><strong>Our Vision</strong> is a Toronto where everyone has equal access to oral health care and the opportunity to achieve overall well-being.</p>
      <h5>Our Goals</h5>
      <p><strong>Our Goals</strong> are to close gaps in access to dental care by providing timely, affordable urgent treatment, reducing oral health inequities, and connecting underserved Torontonians with the care and support they need.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mvg__right">
      <p>Filling the Gap Dental Outreach is a non-profit organization dedicated to reducing barriers to oral healthcare for underserved communities across Toronto. Rather than operating from a single location, we partner with existing community dental clinics throughout the city to provide affordable urgent dental treatment to individuals who may otherwise have nowhere else to turn.</p>
      <p>The people we serve face a range of financial and non-financial barriers to care. This includes individuals without dental benefits, people experiencing homelessness, students, migrant workers, and Canadians who may be unable to access public dental programs.</p>
      <p>What makes Filling the Gap Dental Outreach unique is our community-based and collaborative approach. By using existing clinic spaces and working with volunteer dental professionals, we help close gaps in access to care while making effective use of resources already available within the community.</p>
      <p>Our work is made possible by dentists and dental hygienists who generously volunteer their time and expertise. We welcome oral health professionals at every stage of their careers who share our commitment to providing compassionate, accessible, and dignified care to Torontonians in need.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section impact-about">
  <div class="impact-about__box">
    <h2 class="impact-about__heading">Our Impact<br>in 2025</h2>
    <div class="container">{% set items = widgets['about:0fb7c4e'].items %}{% include "partials/counters.njk" %}</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--light quote">
  <div class="container quote__cols">
    <div class="quote__img"><img src="{{ '/assets/img/FTG-logo-blue-.webp' | url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
    <div class="quote__text">
      <p>Despite the introduction of the Canadian Dental Care Plan, many people still fall through the cracks.</p>
      <p>&nbsp;</p>
      <p>Navigating the complex landscape of public benefits and dental coverage can leave many Torontonians without access to the care they need. We are here to help bridge those gaps and guide individuals toward better oral health.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section video-section">
  <div class="container">
